{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55573","headline":"悟玄颂 · 道怤","name":"悟玄颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有路省人心，学玄者好寻。\n旋机现体骨，何用更沉吟。\n莫嫌浅不食，犹胜意思深。\n鱼若有龙骨，大小尽堪任。\n（以上九首均见《祖堂集》卷十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道怤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}